This repository is a hybrid project assembled from two upstream MIT-licensed
projects and local modifications.

Upstream sources:

- calico32/waybar-niri-windows
  https://github.com/calico32/waybar-niri-windows
  Used as the base for the niri window minimap Waybar CFFI module.

- LawnGnome/niri-taskbar
  https://github.com/lawngnome/niri-taskbar
  Used as the reference for desktop entry based app icon lookup and taskbar-style
  icon handling.

Local modifications in this repository include:

- icon rendering inside minimap tiles
- fallback generic executable icons
- all-workspaces minimap mode
- build/install scripts and repository-local cache layout

Original upstream license texts are preserved in:

- licenses/waybar-niri-windows.MIT
- licenses/niri-taskbar.MIT
